WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Laura Serrano asked for a viewing on Thursday morning. Nobody has taken it yet.

2
00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:13.500
The agent takes the task. The card now says it is theirs, and no one else can take it.

3
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:21.300
Closed. It leaves the list, the rest stays, and the team can see who did it.
